sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User
  participant UI as Browser
  participant API as UI Query API
  participant Proj as Projection Service
  participant SSE as SSE Gateway
  participant EV as Event Log
  participant CMD as Command Facade
  User->>UI: 打开任务详情
  UI->>API: GET /tasks/{id}/projection
  API->>Proj: read-only projection
  Proj->>EV: load event cursor
  Proj-->>API: stage + gates + evidence + binding
  API-->>UI: JSON projection
  UI-->>User: 渲染，不拼装业务状态
  UI->>SSE: subscribe(Last-Event-ID)
  alt 连接断开
    SSE-->>UI: degraded
    UI->>API: bounded polling
  else 实时事件
    SSE-->>UI: event patch
  end
  User->>UI: 点击批准/停止
  UI->>API: POST command with CSRF + idempotency
  API->>CMD: command facade
  CMD-->>UI: accepted / 403 / 409
